@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - ATM Transaction

state "Choose or enter amount" as ChooseAmount
ChooseAmount : entry/Welcome screen
ChooseAmount : do/Show predefined amounts
ChooseAmount : exit/Select predefined amount
ChooseAmount : do/Input custom amount
ChooseAmount : exit/Enter custom amount

state "Cancel transaction" as CancelTransaction
CancelTransaction : entry/User wants to cancel
CancelTransaction : do/Return card and end transaction

state "Check balance" as CheckBalance
CheckBalance : entry/Requested amount is valid
CheckBalance : do/Check available balance
CheckBalance : exit/Proceed with transaction
CheckBalance : do/Notify user if exceeds balance
CheckBalance : exit/End transaction

state "Dispense amount" as DispenseAmount
DispenseAmount : entry/Transaction proceeding
DispenseAmount : do/Dispense requested amount
DispenseAmount : exit/Transaction completed

state "Receive receipt" as ReceiveReceipt
ReceiveReceipt : entry/User wants to receive a receipt
ReceiveReceipt : do/Print receipt
ReceiveReceipt : exit/End transaction

[*] --> ChooseAmount
ChooseAmount --> CancelTransaction
ChooseAmount --> CheckBalance
CheckBalance --> DispenseAmount
DispenseAmount --> ReceiveReceipt
ReceiveReceipt --> [*]
CancelTransaction --> [*] : Return card and end transaction
@enduml
